BRL-CAD maintains and uses a number of external libraries and tools critical
to its functionality that are not installed with the distribution. Generally
these are used either in various stages of the compilation process or as
maintenance tools.

brlinst is a standalone C++17 packaging tool with EXE and native Windows MSI
backends. Its shared product and document preparation code is portable in
preparation for native macOS PKG and DMG backends. Configure misc/tools/brlinst
separately to build it; brlinst/README.adoc documents dependencies, tests, the
optional CPack hook, and the planned macOS integration.

